{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find object, take it, check properties, do task. Scan area if object not found.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInRange    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = DoTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
